abstract: "Paraglacial and geophysical hazard science: GIA/seismicity context (a real Western Alps contrast case), permafrost-driven rock-slope instability, and glacial lake outburst flood (GLOF) exposure. Companion to glacial-seismicity-utac (P101). Deliberately no UTAC/CREP/AFET bridge. GenesisAeon P102."
